    2: Field Name | Field Alias | Field Description | Field Data Source
    3: AREA_NAME | Country or subnational area name | Name of the country or subnational area (administrative division). | U.S. Board on Geographic Names, 2021; Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office, 2012
    4: GEO_CONCAT | Administrative name concatenation | Concatenation of all administrative division names separated by underscores ("_"), beginning with the country name and ending with the division name for the lowest subnational administrative order (level). The field serves as one for name sorting and ordering. | Population Division, U.S. Census Bureau
    5: GEO_MATCH | Geographic match | Identical subnational area identifiers in the Excel table and geospatial data file, enabling linkage (joining) of the table records to the geospatial data file polygons as attributes. | Population Division, U.S. Census Bureau
    6: CNTRY_NAME | Country name | Country name. | U.S. Board on Geographic Names
    7: ADM1_NAME | First-order administrative division name | First-order administrative division name (ADM1), i.e., census divisions. | U.S. Board on Geographic Names, 2021; Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office, 2012
    8: ADM2_NAME | Second-order administrative division name | Second-order administrative division name (ADM2), i.e., enumeration districts. | U.S. Board on Geographic Names, 2021; Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office, 2012
    9: ADM_LEVEL | Administrative level | Administrative level "0" (ADM0/country); administrative level "1" (ADM1); administrative level "2" (ADM2). | Population Division, U.S. Census Bureau
    10: USCBCMNT | Notes | Any notes about a country or subnational division, which may include former names or alternate names or spellings. | Population Division, U.S. Census Bureau
    11: GENC_CODE | GENC code | U.S. Government Geopolitical Entities, Names, and Codes (GENC) Standard (for country and first-order administrative divisions only). | U.S. Government Geopolitical Entities, Names, and Codes (GENC), 2021
    12: FIPS_CODE | FIPS code | U.S. Government Federal Information Processing System (FIPS) code (for country and first-order administrative divisions only). | U.S. Government Federal Information Processing System (FIPS), 2021
    13: NSO_CODE | National statistical office code | Code used by the Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office for a subnational administrative division. | Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office, 2012
    14: PARISH | Parish name | Name of the parish that an enumeration district falls within. | Saint Vincent and The Grenadines Statistical Office, 2012
